    "created_at": "2022-03-04T15:12:16Z",
    "updated_at": "2022-03-04T15:12:16Z",
    "body": "The infrastructure around the `img` element could indeed use improvement, though I haven't looked into it deeply recently.\r\n\r\nBut yeah, the problem is that currently https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/embedded-content.html#dom-img-decode only looks at the current request which might well be completely available (with the previous image) as the pending request only ends up replacing it once fetching is done. (And this means that the example at the top of step 2 does not return results for `stars.jpg` in a conforming browser.)",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
